      "type": "Heading",
      "props": {
       "id": "Heading-202",
       "title": "Artist development for Colorado musicians.",
       "titleTag": "h1",
       "titleClass": "h2 display",
       "lede": "You've probably seen an artist in one photo and known right away who they are and what they might sound like. We help talented musicians become that clear.",
       "headingText": [
        {
         "html": "We get there by working on the whole picture with you. That means positioning (where you fit and who books you), branding, styling and a clear sense of who you are on stage. Sometimes it means finding an archetype that's already in you and leaning all the way into it.",
         "cls": "prose"
        },
        {
         "html": "From there, we help with marketing and with building an audience of people who love what you do.",
         "cls": "prose"
        },
        {
         "html": "The photos and video on this page are where that work shows. For each artist below, we started with who they are, and the styling, the setting and the light all came from the answer.",
         "cls": "prose"
        }
       ]
      }
     },
